Menu manipulation: add via command output, switch to unknown, close errors.
args: -d input

-- stdin --
B <echo brandnew
n
b nope
D x
D nosuchfile
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
 -. input
!
 -. brandnew
?can't open "brandnew": No such file or directory
 -. brandnew
 -  input
?not in menu: "nope"
?warning: no such file `x'
?warning: no such file `nosuchfile'
-- input --
alpha
